IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User jcastellanos34@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass email/Mbsync-jcastellanos34@gmail.com"
SSLType IMAPS
AuthMechs PLAIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/Mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Mail/gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
